As a result of the Device map component migration to Angular, the obsolete `Device list map` AngularJS module (`c8y.parts.deviceListMap`) has been removed from `@c8y/ng1-modules` package. In case your application uses Device map page, you can use the new `deviceMapFeatureProvider` from '@c8y/ngx-components/device-map' package as a replacement.
